claim.claim-text:
a transducer connector (474) configured to connect with an ultrasound transducer (434); and
a handpiece connector (470) configured to connect with an ablation device (16);
wherein the console (422) is configured to connect with a monitor (444);
wherein the console (422) is configured to generate an image comprising a representation of the ablation device (430), and comprising a view of an ultrasound imaging plane associated with the ultrasound transducer (434), and wherein the console is configured to provide the image illustrating a relative position of the ablation device (16) with respect to the ultrasound imaging plane (352) for display by the monitor (444); and
wherein the console (422) is configured to provide a proximity meter (494) via the video interface (490) for display by the monitor (444), the proximity meter (494) indicating a position of a tip of the ablation device (16) relative to the ultrasound imaging plane (352).
